# LinuxOps - Linux Server Monitoring & DevOps Automation

## Overview
LinuxOps is a hands-on DevOps project that automates Linux
system monitoring, log analysis, and server administration.

## Technologies
- Ubuntu Linux
- Bash scripting
- Git and GitHub
- Ansible
- GitHub Actions

## Planned Features
- System health monitoring
- CPU, memory, and disk checks
- Application log analysis
- Automated health reports
- Ansible-based configuration management
- CI/CD using GitHub Actions

## Environment
Ubuntu running on Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL).

## Project Status
Initial setup in progress.
